Inline extension statuses into the footer's stats line when they fit.

Statuses otherwise always take a third footer line, even a single short indicator
such as pi-tldraw's "│ • tldraw" on a terminal with room to spare beside the model.
That dot is purely decorative, so when it does not fit it is dropped, never given a line.

